# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback for the React Router app.
# Note: when a _routes.json exists (it does, in this project), Functions
# matching "include" patterns (e.g. /api/*) are ALWAYS handled by Pages
# Functions before these rules apply, so this rule cannot shadow the API.
# The previous bare `/* /index.html 200` line was rejected by Cloudflare's
# redirect parser ("Infinite loop detected ... Parsed 0 valid redirect
# rules"), which left deep links like /admin/login with no SPA fallback and
# caused blank pages. The explicit !/assets exclusion below parses cleanly.
/assets/*  /assets/:splat  200
!/*.html   /*              200
/*         /index.html     200